# Development only. No secrets are required for fixture runs.
# ML_ENVIRONMENT: development or test; production is rejected until pilot gates pass.
# ML_AUTH_MODE: demo development identity (not a live OIDC connection).
# ML_RUNNER_MODE: fixture; customer execution is disabled.
# ML_DATABASE_URL: PostgreSQL connection, supplied outside source control.
# ML_ARTIFACT_ROOT: local immutable fictional evidence directory (default artifacts).
# ML_TEMPORAL_ADDRESS: local Temporal address (default localhost:7233).
# ML_EMERGENCY_STOP: true disables new execution and publication.
